---
// src/pages/volunteer-resources/index.astro
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Volunteer Resources — Skovgard 2026"
  description="Tools, downloads, training, and everything you need to volunteer for Skovgard for Senate."
>
  <Nav />
  <main class="pt-24 pb-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">

      <!-- Header -->
      <p class="text-wy-gold font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm mb-2">Volunteer Hub</p>
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-wy-navy mb-4">Volunteer Resources</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg mb-10">
        Everything you need to hit the ground running: flyers, affidavits, training, and meeting times.
        Questions? Email <a href="mailto:skovgard2026@gmail.com" class="text-wy-gold hover:underline">skovgard2026@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>

      <!-- Quick Start -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-wy-navy mb-4 border-b border-wy-gold pb-2">Quick Start</h2>
        <ol class="space-y-3 text-gray-700 list-decimal list-inside">
          <li>Download the volunteer flyer and campaign flyer below.</li>
          <li>Print a stack and bring them to your next community event, church, or coffee shop.</li>
          <li>Collect signatures on the affidavit form and mail them in (address below).</li>
          <li>Join a Saturday training call to connect with the team.</li>
          <li>Sign up for the <a href="/pulse/signup/" class="text-wy-gold hover:underline font-semibold">Pulse texting circle</a> to stay in the loop and forward updates.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <!-- Downloads -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-wy-navy mb-4 border-b border-wy-gold pb-2">Downloads</h2>
        <div class="grid gap-4">

          <a
            href="/resources/Volunteer%20Flyer.pdf"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-wy-gold transition-all group"
          >
            <span class="text-3xl">📄</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-wy-navy group-hover:text-wy-gold transition-colors">Volunteer Flyer</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">PDF: print and distribute at community events</p>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a
            href="/resources/Jimmy%20Skovgard%20for%20US%20Senate.pdf"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-wy-gold transition-all group"
          >
            <span class="text-3xl">📄</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-wy-navy group-hover:text-wy-gold transition-colors">Campaign Flyer</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">PDF: Jimmy Skovgard for U.S. Senate</p>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a
            href="/resources/VoterRegistrationForm.pdf"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-wy-gold transition-all group"
          >
            <span class="text-3xl">🗳️</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-wy-navy group-hover:text-wy-gold transition-colors">Wyoming Voter Registration Form</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">PDF: help neighbors get registered</p>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a
            href="/resources/affidavit-qr.png"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-wy-gold transition-all group"
          >
            <span class="text-3xl">🔲</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-wy-navy group-hover:text-wy-gold transition-colors">Affidavit QR Code</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">PNG: print or share so signers can pull up the form on their phone</p>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a
            href="/resources/Wyoming-Affidavit-Template-Fillable-2026-v3.pdf"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-wy-gold transition-all group"
          >
            <span class="text-3xl">✍️</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-wy-navy group-hover:text-wy-gold transition-colors">Fillable Affidavit PDF</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">PDF: Wyoming Affidavit Template (2026 v3)</p>
            </div>
          </a>

        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Affidavit -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-wy-navy mb-4 border-b border-wy-gold pb-2">Affidavit Submission</h2>
        <div class="bg-wy-stone rounded-xl p-6 border border-amber-200">
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Once you've collected signed affidavits, mail them to us. Every signature matters. Thank you for doing this work.
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <p class="font-bold text-wy-navy">Mailing Address:</p>
            <address class="not-italic text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-4 border-wy-gold">
              Skovgard for Senate<br />
              5685 Hanly Mills<br />
              Casper, WY 82604
            </address>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4">
            <p class="font-bold text-wy-navy">Email:</p>
            <a href="mailto:skovgard2026@gmail.com" class="text-wy-gold hover:underline">skovgard2026@gmail.com</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Training -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-wy-navy mb-4 border-b border-wy-gold pb-2">Training</h2>
        <div class="prose prose-lg text-gray-600">
          <p>
            New volunteers receive a short orientation covering Wyoming ballot access law, how to approach conversations
            with voters, and how to handle affidavit paperwork correctly. Training is done live on Saturday Zoom calls
            or one-on-one by email request.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Never pressure a signer. All signatures must be freely given.</li>
            <li>Verify the signer is a registered Wyoming voter before collecting the affidavit.</li>
            <li>Keep all completed forms safe and mail them in promptly.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Meetings -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-wy-navy mb-4 border-b border-wy-gold pb-2">Weekly Meetings</h2>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm p-6">
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
            <span class="font-bold text-wy-navy">Every Saturday at 10:00 AM Mountain Time</span>, via Zoom
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4">
            We cover updates from the campaign trail, answer questions, coordinate canvassing, and celebrate wins.
            Email <a href="mailto:skovgard2026@gmail.com" class="text-wy-gold hover:underline">skovgard2026@gmail.com</a> to get the Zoom link.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic">Can't make Saturdays? Reach out and we'll find a way to connect.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Texting Circles -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-wy-navy mb-4 border-b border-wy-gold pb-2">Texting Circles</h2>
        <div class="prose prose-lg text-gray-600 mb-4">
          <p>
            The Pulse texting circle is how we amplify the campaign's reach without spending a dime on ads. When you
            receive a campaign update, forward it personally to people you know and trust: neighbors, family, friends.
            A text from someone they know is worth a hundred mailers.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a
          href="/pulse/signup/"
          class="inline-block bg-wy-gold text-wy-navy font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded hover:bg-amber-400 transition-colors"
        >
          Join the Texting Circle →
        </a>
      </section>

      <!-- Code of Conduct -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-wy-navy mb-4 border-b border-wy-gold pb-2">Code of Conduct</h2>
        <div class="prose prose-lg text-gray-600">
          <p>
            We represent Jimmy Skovgard and Wyoming voters with every interaction. Please hold yourself to these standards:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Be respectful.</strong> Every voter deserves courtesy, regardless of their party.</li>
            <li><strong>Be honest.</strong> Never misrepresent Jimmy's positions or the campaign's status.</li>
            <li><strong>Be safe.</strong> If a situation feels unsafe, leave and report it.</li>
            <li><strong>No harassment.</strong> Do not follow, pressure, or contact voters who decline.</li>
            <li><strong>Represent the campaign well.</strong> Dress neatly, speak clearly, and thank people for their time.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            Volunteers who violate these standards may be removed from the program.
            If you have concerns, contact <a href="mailto:skovgard2026@gmail.com" class="text-wy-gold hover:underline">skovgard2026@gmail.com</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
